AUDIT

Every pkg subcommand journals to /system/audit/user-events/
pkg-<ts>-<audit_id>.pdxevent before emitting any output. The
audit record shape (libpdx-audit v0.2):

  audit_id      : u64            -- monotonic per-tool counter
  tool          : "pkg"
  subcommand    : "install" | "remove" | "list" | "verify" | "keys"
  argv          : bytes          -- full argv for reconstruction
  user          : Cap<KIND_USER> -- invoker identity
  output_schema : "pdxsig.pkg.pmf.v1" | "pdxsig.pkg.ipr.v1" | ...
  output_hash   : [u8;32]        -- sha3-256 of the emitted bytes
  exit_code     : i32
  wall_time_ns  : u64

`pkg install` additionally journals one InstallProgressRecord per
stage to the semantic pipe (not the audit journal); the audit
journal records the final exit only.

VERSION

pkg 1.0.0 (2026-08-22). See CHANGELOG.md in the pkg repo for the
per-milestone rollup and known limitations at 1.0-close.
